Option 2: Buy 9 packages of 2 flowers. The cost is $9 \times 1.00 = $9.00$.
Option 3: Buy 18 flowers in packages of 3. We need to buy $18/3 = 6$ packages of 3 flowers. The cost is $6 \times 2.50 = $15.00$.
Option 4: Buy 18 flowers in packages of 2. We need to buy $18/2 = 9$ packages of 2 flowers. The cost is $9 \times 1.00 = $9.00$.

